# Releases

Packages version independently (`@useavalon/avalon`, integrations, `create-avalon`). Do not hand-edit version fields — use `scripts/bump-version.ts` or the workflows.

- **canary**: push to `main`, changed packages only (`X.Y.Z-canary.YYYYMMDD.sha`).
- **beta** / **rc** / **stable**: manual `release.yml` (`workflow_dispatch`). Dry-run is the default.
- `--package=all` only when a core/shared API break hits every integration.
- Tags are scoped (`core/v0.2.0`). CI: `ci.yml` lint/format/typecheck; `canary.yml` publishes changed packages.
